SUMMARY:Thursday nights on the green in Windsor
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\nJoin us for Thursd
 ay Nights on the Green in Windsor—a lively evening of free live music\, 
 food vendors\, and community fun in the heart of downtown! Bring a blanket
  or lawn chair\, grab a bite from one of the local food trucks\, and enjoy
  a summer evening filled with great tunes and even better company. It’s 
 the perfect way to wind down your week and soak up the good vibes with fri
 ends.\n\nWe will meet at the cross Street of McCelland st. and Market st. 
 just outside of Tian Yuen and find a spot to hang out\, relax and enjoy th
 e vibes.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/315402157/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260624T204649Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260624T204649Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:North Bay Social Group
UID:event_315879905@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260729T222938Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260802T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260802T170000
SUMMARY:Chill\, Sip and Draw
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\nLet’s get togeth
 er for a chill low pressure event . You can draw\, sketch \, read \, write
 \, talk\, not talk\, or simply hangout. The point is that we get together 
 and stay out of the heat ! Location is walking distance to Petaluma downto
 wn smart train station If you are coming from out of town .
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/315879905/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260728T211314Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T211314Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:North Bay Social Group
UID:event_315702689@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260729T222938Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260804T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260804T203000
SUMMARY:Trivia at Trailhead (Novato) 
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\n🎉 Join Us for T
 rivia Night! 🧠☕️\nThis event is cross-posted with Sonoma Marin Brat
  Pack\, Marin County Millennials\, and North Bay 20s30s Meetup\, so RSVPs 
 may not reflect the full crowd.\n\nWe’re Team Quizzards! I’ll be at mo
 st events\, and if I can’t make it\, you’ll still find some friendly r
 egulars there. Look for us at the back of the coffee shop — come say hi 
 and join the fun! 🎉\n\n🕡 Trivia kicks off promptly at 6:30 PM\, so s
 wing by a bit earlier if you'd like to grab a drink or something tasty to 
 eat before we get started. I plan to be there at 6 pm to try to get us a g
 ood table .\n📍 Location:\nTrailhead Coffee\n127 San Marin Drive\, Novat
 o\, CA\nBring your friends\, your appetite\, and your A-game — see you t
 here! 🙌
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/315702689/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260716T012622Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260716T012622Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
